{"id":"3744a99e6a5c0037","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-elementary-topos.md","title":"Elementary topos","display":"df-elementary-topos — Elementary topos","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-elementary-topos","aliases":["16-df-elementary-topos","Elementary topos"],"display":"df-elementary-topos — Elementary topos","depends_on":["[[16-df-category]]","[[16-df-finite-limits]]","[[16-df-ccc-definition]]","[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]"],"source":"Definition 5.4.1(i), p. 339 (PDF 359)","revision_date":"2026-10-15"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-elementary-topos"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-elementary-topos</span><span>Elementary topos</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elementary-topos — Elementary topos"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"55e78399bad5fbe9\" href=\"?note=55e78399bad5fbe9\" title=\"16-df-subobject-classifier\">16-df-subobject-classifier</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 5.4.1(i), p. 339 (PDF 359)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为候选范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinLim}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinLim}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubObjCl}\">\\(\\mathrm{SubObjCl}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"18a4c8ba03fadf06\" href=\"?note=18a4c8ba03fadf06\" title=\"16-df-ccc-definition\">16-df-ccc-definition</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"55e78399bad5fbe9\" href=\"?note=55e78399bad5fbe9\" title=\"16-df-subobject-classifier\">16-df-subobject-classifier</a>。</li>\n<li>在子对象分类子谓词中，终对象取同一存在量词中选定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElemTopos}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElemTopos}\\)</span> 是下文定义的性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\exists1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\\Bigl[\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\n(\\exists!h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,1))\\ h=h\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\exists\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\n(\\exists\\top\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(1,\\Omega))\\\n\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal C}(\\Omega,\\top)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\exists1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\\Bigl[\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\n(\\exists!h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,1))\\ h=h\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\exists\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\n(\\exists\\top\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(1,\\Omega))\\\n\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal C}(\\Omega,\\top)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ElemTopos}(\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathcal C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ElemTopos}(\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathcal C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用统一有限极限谓词，删除了本页与其冲突的第二套有限极限定义。指数与分类子的泛性质由本书同目录的定义给出。</li>\n<li>终对象的显式选择是为了绑定分类箭头的定义域，不增加数学假设；更换终对象只改变同构的分类数据。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, Definition 5.4.1(i), p. 339（PDF 第 359 页）。本页仅给出定义；与高阶子对象纤维化的等价另需 Corollary 5.4.9。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-ccc-definition","status":"resolved","id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depen