\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\\Bigl[\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\n(\\exists!h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,1))\\ h=h\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(\\exists\\Omega\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\n(\\exists\\top\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(1,\\Omega))\\\n\\mathrm{SubObjCl}_{\\mathcal C}(\\Omega,\\top)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ElemTopos}(\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathcal C).","display":true}],"bytes":1929,"backlinks":[{"id":"19a4de86b7fb034e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为候选范畴；$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}$ 采用 [[16-df-elementary-topos]] 的规范谓词，$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 是本页待定义的旧拼写。"},{"id":"f5fbbc7a13ebbdd7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7b9d7a3ecba84e9e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e3878d9cc72edc34","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"41fafdce78743585","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}$ 采用 [[16-df-elementary-topos]]；$\\mathrm{Topos}_0$ 是本页定义的旧拼写。"},{"id":"939ed0c717cef4ab","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8cc0e0e038ae9b87","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为候选范畴；$\\mathrm{FinLim}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]。在有限极限存在的分支中，$p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}:\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal E)\\to\\mathcal E$ 使用 [[16-df-subobject-fibration]]。$\\mathrm{HOFib}$、$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-elementary-topos]]。"},{"id":"6473f3f235aa7951","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{ElemTopos}$ 采用 [[16-df-elementary-topos]]；$\\mathsf{Topos}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 是本页定义的旧拼写。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]、[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]、[[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-pullback-square]]、[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]、[[16-df-elementary-topos]]、[[16-df-nno]]、[[16-df-fibre]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]、[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-fibre-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]。"},{"id":"a79a60a788ea47ca","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为范畴，$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}$ 采用 [[16-df-elementary-topos]]，$\\mathrm{FinLim}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]，$\\mathcal E^{\\mathrm{op}}$ 采用 [[16-df-functor]] 的反范畴构造。"},{"id":"da4a5dccfe412249","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为范畴。$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}$ 采用 [[16-df-elementary-topos]]，$\\mathrm{FinLim}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]，$\\mathrm{PowObjAll}$ 采用 [[16-df-power-object]]。"},{"id":"55e5037ed821c800","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tripos}$、$\\mathrm{SplitTripos}$、$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-tripos]]、[[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-elementary-topos]]。"},{"id":"26271d2146c7481f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["25a281534aa42440","b75e7c168ac56b22","18a4c8ba03fadf06","55e78399bad5fbe9"]}